{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'scripts/bin/harness-cli --help && scripts/bin/harness-cli intake --help'","aggregated_output":"durable layer for the project harness\n\nUsage: harness-cli <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  init           Create the harness database if it does not already exist\n  migrate        Apply schema migrations\n  import         Seed or refresh the database from existing markdown state\n  intake         Record a feature intake classification\n  story          Add or update a story\n  decision       Add a decision or run its verification\n  backlog        Add or close a backlog item\n  tool           Register or remove external tools\n  intervention   Record a human, review, CI, or agent intervention\n  trace          Record an agent execution trace\n  score-trace    Score a trace against the trace quality tiers\n  score-context  Score trace context reads against CONTEXT_RULES.md\n  audit          Run drift audit and entropy score\n  propose        Generate improvement proposals from observed patterns\n  db             Manage harness database changesets\n  query          Query harness data\n  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help     Print help\n  -V, --version  Print version\nRecord a feature intake classification\n\nUsage: harness-cli intake [OPTIONS] --type <INPUT_TYPE> --summary <SUMMARY> --lane <tiny|normal|high-risk>\n\nOptions:\n      --type <INPUT_TYPE>             \n      --summary <SUMMARY>             \n      --lane <tiny|normal|high-risk>  \n      --flags <FLAGS>                 \n      --docs <DOCS>                   \n      --story <STORY>                 \n      --notes <NOTES>                 \n  -h, --help                          Print help\n\nAccepted lanes: tiny, normal, high-risk. Use tiny instead of low.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
